  "references": {
    "1": {
      "note": "Projection input refreshers collect native per-kind AttentionObservations and reconcile acknowledgements through AttentionDismissalStore. A record can be reclaimed for source absence, healthy recovery or a changed known fingerprint only when the observation is complete and started no earlier than its dismissal; the first complete fingerprint can instead be adopted. Unread/incomplete kinds retain their acknowledgements. Reconciliation is locked, avoids unchanged physical writes and returns prior current acknowledgements if cleanup fails; this is not prune_lifecycles after a lifecycle fold.",
